<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 11:19:17 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>阿波罗收购迫在眉睫，易捷航空利润因伊朗战争而受到打击</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/easyjet-profit-hit-by-middle-east-war-as-apollo-takeover-looms</link><description>易捷航空表示，中东战争的影响侵蚀了该公司本财年的大部分利润，燃油价格飙升对这家廉价航空公司造成了打击，该公司正准备于明年初被一家美国私募股权公司收购。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/easyjet-profit-hit-by-middle-east-war-as-apollo-takeover-looms'&gt;阿波罗收购迫在眉睫，易捷航空利润因伊朗战争而受到打击&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：EasyJet Profit Hit By Iran War as Apollo Takeover Looms&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/easyjet-profit-hit-by-middle-east-war-as-apollo-takeover-looms</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 07:16:22 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>ING 认为新兴市场货币正在“全面放松”</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/ing-sees-full-unwind-in-emerging-market-currencies-underway</link><description>荷兰国际银行(ING Bank)策略师表示，新兴市场货币面临着来自技术抛售、利率溢价缩小的风险以及新的全球关税威胁的越来越大的压力。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/ing-sees-full-unwind-in-emerging-market-currencies-underway'&gt;ING 认为新兴市场货币正在“全面放松”&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：ING Sees ‘Full Unwind’ in Emerging-Market Currencies Underway&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/ing-sees-full-unwind-in-emerging-market-currencies-underway</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 10:29:45 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>市场动荡创造了 3850 亿美元的赢家：印度</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/indian-stocks-extend-world-beating-run-as-ai-selloff-resumes</link><description>印度股市延续了 11 月份全球领先的涨势，卢比兑美元汇率创下八个月新高，因为人工智能行业的新一轮抛售刺激了对该国资产的需求。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/indian-stocks-extend-world-beating-run-as-ai-selloff-resumes'&gt;市场动荡创造了 3850 亿美元的赢家：印度&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Market Convulsions Create a $385 Billion Winner: India&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/indian-stocks-extend-world-beating-run-as-ai-selloff-resumes</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 05:04:20 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>科技股下跌削弱风险偏好，国债上涨</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/treasuries-rise-across-curve-as-ai-concerns-dent-risk-sentiment</link><description>由于科技股再度下跌，削弱了投资者对风险资产的兴趣，美国国债周三全线上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/treasuries-rise-across-curve-as-ai-concerns-dent-risk-sentiment'&gt;科技股下跌削弱风险偏好，国债上涨&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Treasuries Rally as Tech Stock Losses Dent Risk Appetite&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/treasuries-rise-across-curve-as-ai-concerns-dent-risk-sentiment</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 06:49:34 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Advent 考虑收购测试公司 Bureau Veritas</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/advent-weighs-takeover-of-testing-firm-bureau-veritas</link><description>据知情人士透露，Advent 正在考虑收购法国测试公司 Bureau Veritas SA，这将是今年欧洲公司最大的收购之一。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/advent-weighs-takeover-of-testing-firm-bureau-veritas'&gt;Advent 考虑收购测试公司 Bureau Veritas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Advent Weighs Takeover Of Testing Firm Bureau Veritas&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/advent-weighs-takeover-of-testing-firm-bureau-veritas</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 19:58:23 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>